  "question": {
    "text": "A parallel plate capacitor has a capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo> </mo><mi>pF</mi></math>. It is connected to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>230</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> ac supply with an angular frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo> </mo><mi>rad</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The rms value of conduction current in the circuit and displacement current in the capacitor respectively are :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "pNmzf",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.38</mo><mi>μA</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.38</mo><mi>μA</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Hw2zb",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>.3</mo><mi>μA</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>143</mn><mo> </mo><mi>μA</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uheRp",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mo>.8</mo><mi>μA</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>138</mn><mo> </mo><mi>μA</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LcKDs",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mo>.8</mo><mo> </mo><mi>μA</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mo>.8</mo><mo> </mo><mi>μA</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
